flowchart TD
    %% Styling Classes
    classDef entity fill:#0f172a,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff,font-weight:bold;
    classDef process fill:#1e3a8a,stroke:#3b82f6,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff;
    classDef store fill:#064e3b,stroke:#10b981,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff;
    classDef audit fill:#7c2d12,stroke:#ef4444,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff;
    classDef output fill:#312e81,stroke:#818cf8,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff,font-weight:bold;

    %% Entities
    E1["👤 Advocate"]:::entity
    E2["👮 Police IO"]:::entity
    E3["⚖️ Judge"]:::entity
    E5["🛡️ Admin"]:::entity

    %% Persistent Data Stores
    D1[("[(D1)] In-Memory Raw Stream Buffer<br>RAM Decoded Bytes")]:::store
    D2[("[(D2)] Extracted Entity & Fact Cache<br>Session State JSON")]:::store
    D3[("[(D3)] Statutory Knowledge Master<br>JSONL BNS / BNSS / Constitution")]:::store
    D4[("[(D4)] Qdrant Dense Vector Space<br>10,000+ Judgments - 384-Dim BGE")]:::store
    D5[("[(D5)] Criminal Registry & ML Models<br>Trained KNN & Random Forest")]:::store
    D6[("[(D6)] Verified Dossiers & Petitions<br>Client Session / MongoDB")]:::store

    %% Major Subsystems
    P1["1.0 MULTIMODAL INGESTION & LOCAL OCR<br>• PyMuPDF In-Memory Rasterization<br>• Zero-Poppler Stream Decoding<br>• Tesseract Binary Auto-Discovery"]:::process

    P2["2.0 ENTITY EXTRACTION & STATUTE MAPPING<br>• Regex & LLM Entity Parser<br>• Bidirectional IPC to BNS & CrPC to BNSS Cross-Mapping"]:::process

    P3["3.0 DUAL-COLLECTION RETRIEVAL & ML PROFILING<br>• 3.1 Statutory Rules Querying [D3]<br>• 3.2 Dense Precedent Vector Search [D4]<br>• 3.3 Offline ML Modus Operandi Matching [D5]"]:::process

    P4["4.0 LANGGRAPH MULTI-AGENT STATE SYNTHESIS<br>• Stateful Multi-Actor DAG Pipeline<br>• Multi-Tier LLM [Gemini 1.5 Flash / Groq]<br>• SC Order XXI & 11-Language Regional Drafting"]:::process

    P5["5.0 CITATION VERIFICATION & GROUNDING AUDIT<br>• Deterministic Set-Intersection Check<br>• Grounding Score Cg = Intersection / Total * 100%<br>• Red-Flag Quarantine for Unverified Laws"]:::audit

    P6["6.0 DOSSIER PACKAGING & MULTILINGUAL OUTPUT<br>• Glassmorphic Presentation Console<br>• Cross-Tab Context Broadcast Sync<br>• Court-Paper Print & Copy Engine"]:::output

    P7["7.0 DATASET INGESTION & MODEL TRAINING<br>• Batch PDF & Dataset Ingestion<br>• Scikit-Learn Model Training"]:::process

    %% Data Ingestion Flows
    E1 -->|"Uploads FIR Document / Facts"| P1
    E2 -->|"Uploads FIR & Suspect Demographics"| P1
    E5 -->|"Triggers Batch GPU Ingestion & ML Training"| P7

    P7 -->|"Builds Master Catalogs"| D3
    P7 -->|"Indexes 384-Dim Case Vectors"| D4
    P7 -->|"Saves Trained Weights [.joblib]"| D5

    P1 -->|"Stores Decoded Byte Buffers"| D1
    D1 -->|"Streams Decoded Clean Text"| P2

    %% Entity Parsing Flows
    P2 -->|"Saves Structured Legal Entities"| D2
    D2 -->|"Transfers Case Summary & Sections"| P3

    %% Dual-Collection RAG & ML Lookups
    D3 <-->|"Statutory Provisions & Penal Safeguards"| P3
    D4 <-->|"Dense Precedent Vector Search [Cosine >= 0.60]"| P3
    D5 <-->|"KNN MO Distance & RF Risk Probabilities"| P3

    %% Feeding Context into Agentic Synthesis
    P3 -->|"Aggregated Grounded Legal Context"| P4
    D2 -->|"Original Case Allegations & Dates"| P4

    %% Synthesis & Verification Gate
    P4 -->|"Synthesizes Draft Petition & Dossier"| P5
    D3 -.->|"Ground-Truth Legislative Verification Catalog"| P5

    %% Final Packaging & Output
    P5 -->|"Audited Output + Grounding Score Cg"| P6
    P6 -->|"Archives Verified Petition"| D6

    P6 ==>|"Supreme Court SLP Draft & Verified Citations"| E1
    P6 ==>|"Suspect Syndicate Matches & Recidivism Profile"| E2
    P6 ==>|"Court-Ready Dossier & Hallucination Audit Report"| E3
